WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 8]

01:52.580 --> 01:53.140
Xuanye.

02:22.320 --> 02:22.950
Xuanye!

02:24.310 --> 02:25.030
Xuanye!

02:25.910 --> 02:26.500
Xuanye.

02:27.310 --> 02:28.590
No signs of escape detected.

02:31.329 --> 02:31.930
Xuanye.

03:33.870 --> 03:34.400
Get out!

03:35.000 --> 03:36.120
You ruined my mood.

04:18.430 --> 04:19.480
Why are you crying?

04:31.360 --> 04:32.560
W-Who's speaking?

04:35.060 --> 04:35.940
Don't you like this

04:35.960 --> 04:37.030
aging face?

04:40.150 --> 04:41.800
Do you want to regain your youth?

04:44.920 --> 04:45.430
I do.

04:46.360 --> 04:47.000
I do.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.120
Then you need to promise me

04:50.120 --> 04:51.120
one condition.

04:52.190 --> 04:53.270
Are you willing?

05:02.680 --> 05:03.360
I am.

05:04.390 --> 05:05.720
You need to promise me

05:06.920 --> 05:08.430
to stay by my side forever.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.630
You only need to agree

05:13.390 --> 05:14.600
and I can make you

05:15.360 --> 05:16.610
eternally youthful.

06:31.000 --> 06:31.510
Li.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.720
Because I promised you

06:34.360 --> 06:35.970
I will definitely marry you properly.

06:37.110 --> 06:37.900
I also want everyone in the city

06:37.930 --> 06:38.930
to know

06:40.070 --> 06:41.630
that the woman who will become my wife

06:42.720 --> 06:44.430
is the most beautiful woman in the world.

06:45.430 --> 06:46.760
No matter how you change,

06:48.150 --> 06:49.600
I will forever

06:50.510 --> 06:51.190
cherish you,

06:51.720 --> 06:52.310
love you,

06:53.360 --> 06:54.070
and be good to you.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.240
Do you remember now?

07:21.630 --> 07:22.420
They all covet

07:22.450 --> 07:23.450
your beauty.

07:24.870 --> 07:25.870
They don't understand you.

07:28.160 --> 07:29.040
Only I

07:30.430 --> 07:31.720
am the one who loves you the most.

07:33.430 --> 07:34.560
So the people I loved

07:35.520 --> 07:36.790
were all killed by you,

07:37.800 --> 07:38.480
one

07:38.720 --> 07:39.560
after another.

07:40.600 --> 07:41.720
I'm going to kill you!

07:47.120 --> 07:48.270
You promised me.

07:49.480 --> 07:50.480
You can't leave me.

07:50.680 --> 07:51.680
Ever.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.510
You were great before.

07:56.460 --> 07:57.240
It was them.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.430
They corrupted you.

08:02.950 --> 08:04.040
They're the bad ones,

08:04.600 --> 08:05.310
not you.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.480
I've already locked them up.

08:15.310 --> 08:16.310
All those bad things

08:17.920 --> 08:18.830
are forgotten.

08:20.120 --> 08:20.750
Li,

08:22.510 --> 08:23.920
let's start over,

08:25.190 --> 08:25.870
okay?

08:27.750 --> 08:28.390
Okay?

09:06.440 --> 09:07.670
Playing tricks.

09:10.480 --> 09:11.160
Xuanye.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.400
Wait for me.

09:48.460 --> 09:49.100
Xuanye!

09:54.000 --> 09:55.600
Who let you in?

09:57.630 --> 09:58.870
Xuanye, save me!

10:20.910 --> 10:21.510
Don't be afraid.

10:21.790 --> 10:22.550
I'm here to save you.

10:24.790 --> 10:26.630
You've got some skills, demon.

10:29.040 --> 10:29.880
Go find a spot in the back

10:29.910 --> 10:30.630
and take a good look

10:31.000 --> 10:32.080
at how I deal with him.

10:33.000 --> 10:34.430
You be careful.

10:34.460 --> 10:35.270
Don't worry.

10:36.840 --> 10:37.480
Okay.

10:39.910 --> 10:41.150
Such arrogance

10:42.790 --> 10:44.240
Whether I have arrogance or real skills,

10:44.260 --> 10:45.350
you'll find out soon enough.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.480
Greedy Wolf!

11:07.360 --> 11:08.000
Xuanye.

11:14.480 --> 11:15.200
Don't worry.

11:15.480 --> 11:17.080
No demons alive now can hurt me.

11:20.870 --> 11:21.750
Mountain Shaker.

11:38.800 --> 11:39.490
Be careful.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.080
Don't panic.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.600
I'm deliberately letting him have a few moves.

11:52.910 --> 11:54.030
Everything is under control.

12:08.870 --> 12:09.510
Xuanye.

12:12.390 --> 12:13.240
Are you alright?

12:14.360 --> 12:15.000
I'm fine.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.390
Everything is under control.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.440
Why don't you draw your sword?

12:21.960 --> 12:23.960
A mere minor demon isn't worth drawing my sword for.

12:26.240 --> 12:28.490
You seem a bit different.

12:30.000 --> 12:30.750
How am I different?

12:32.390 --> 12:33.030
Kid,

12:33.910 --> 12:34.910
don't you understand yet?

12:35.320 --> 12:36.200
Understand what?

12:36.720 --> 12:37.840
You touched my mirror.

12:38.550 --> 12:39.270
A part of you

12:39.270 --> 12:40.150
has been sealed by me.

12:40.830 --> 12:42.080
You're no match for me now.

12:42.630 --> 12:43.350
Bah!

12:43.870 --> 12:45.120
You're quite an old demon.

12:45.150 --> 12:46.240
Have some shame, will you?

13:21.720 --> 13:22.480
Xuanye, don't!

13:23.080 --> 13:23.870
Don't!

13:24.270 --> 13:25.080
Wake up!

13:27.000 --> 13:27.750
Xuanye!

14:38.360 --> 14:39.030
Come on!

15:42.440 --> 15:43.270
Where is he?

16:34.750 --> 16:35.270
Li.

16:36.340 --> 16:37.030
Li.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.270
Come with me.

16:46.360 --> 16:46.960
Xuanye.

16:48.030 --> 16:48.750
Let me out.

16:49.600 --> 16:50.480
Let me out!

16:51.270 --> 16:52.510
I'll kill you!

16:52.630 --> 16:53.600
Ms. Ji Li?

16:56.830 --> 16:58.600
Let me out!

16:59.000 --> 17:00.840
I'll kill you!

17:05.200 --> 17:06.480
I really underestimated you.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.480
I have something to ask you.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.069
You'd better answer honestly.

17:12.829 --> 17:14.160
You don't understand what I'm saying?

17:15.270 --> 17:16.720
You once kidnapped

17:16.900 --> 17:17.609
someone named Duan Yingheng

17:17.640 --> 17:18.480
in Nanyang City.

17:18.960 --> 17:19.790
Where is he now?

17:22.000 --> 17:23.200
In Penglai Alley, Nanyang City,

17:23.200 --> 17:24.270
someone set fire to

17:25.119 --> 17:25.920
the third house

17:25.950 --> 17:26.990
on the left.

17:27.270 --> 17:28.480
I saw a mirror at the scene

17:28.510 --> 17:29.790
that couldn't reflect people.

17:30.310 --> 17:31.750
There was one in my father's room too.

17:32.820 --> 17:34.470
So was it you who set the fire, killed people,

17:34.500 --> 17:35.460
and kidnapped my father?

17:36.720 --> 17:37.590
It was me.

17:38.030 --> 17:38.750
Why?

17:39.200 --> 17:39.960
Half a year ago,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.610
I was entrusted by a senior from the demon clan

17:43.560 --> 17:44.430
to capture your father.

17:46.750 --> 17:47.750
When we were in Yuanzhou,

17:48.440 --> 17:49.680
I almost succeeded.

17:50.590 --> 17:51.400
He was very alert.

17:52.160 --> 17:54.400
He fled to Nanyang with his family.

17:55.340 --> 17:56.380
I chased after him.

17:57.310 --> 17:58.720
Just as I was about to succeed,

18:00.510 --> 18:01.310
a demon

18:02.750 --> 18:03.830
intervened.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.510
It lent your father a life.

18:07.070 --> 18:07.880
Lent a life?

18:08.550 --> 18:09.030
Yes.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.030
He took on your father's appearance

18:12.330 --> 18:13.540
and staged that fire,

18:14.130 --> 18:16.810
helping him fake his death and escape.

18:17.480 --> 18:18.720
It almost fooled me.

18:20.200 --> 18:20.830
Fortunately,

18:20.880 --> 18:22.000
I tracked him to your home

18:23.440 --> 18:24.440
and captured him.

18:48.440 --> 18:49.110
Father?

18:52.030 --> 18:52.720
Father!

18:54.780 --> 18:55.630
What's wrong?

19:00.290 --> 19:01.160
I beg you.

19:02.240 --> 19:03.400
Please don't hurt my daughter.

19:04.590 --> 19:05.270
I'm begging you.

19:06.200 --> 19:07.070
I implore you.

19:09.060 --> 19:10.030
Spare my daughter.

19:10.790 --> 19:11.790
I'll go with you.

19:12.590 --> 19:13.750
So that night,

19:14.590 --> 19:15.960
you were in the room too.

19:16.500 --> 19:17.570
How could anything happen to me?

19:18.070 --> 19:18.750
I'm just

19:18.960 --> 19:20.440
tired from organizing manuscripts without rest.

19:20.830 --> 19:21.920
I'm really a bit exhausted.

19:29.550 --> 19:31.160
Who's the demon that made you capture him?

19:31.830 --> 19:32.590
Where is he?

19:34.960 --> 19:35.680
Speak.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.270
Alright,

19:41.160 --> 19:41.920
I'll tell you.

20:25.480 --> 20:26.640
Let's go.

20:28.930 --> 20:29.750
Chi Wangchuan.

20:31.440 --> 20:32.030
Banxia,

20:32.120 --> 20:32.880
stop Ji Li.

20:37.000 --> 20:37.880
Ms. Ji Li.

22:04.200 --> 22:04.960
Li.

22:08.640 --> 22:09.480
Li.

22:10.030 --> 22:10.720
Chuan.

22:11.830 --> 22:12.400
Chuan.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.590
Chuan.

22:14.630 --> 22:17.000
♫Tying dark locks♫

22:17.020 --> 22:20.310
♫To end this love♫

22:21.720 --> 22:27.420
♫How to break off the entangled love and hate?♫

22:22.510 --> 22:23.400
Chuan!

22:24.510 --> 22:25.400
Chuan.

22:27.780 --> 22:33.190
♫Sorrows and joys can't be reflected fully in mirrors♫

22:29.480 --> 22:30.200
Chuan!

22:33.550 --> 22:39.960
♫Accompanying each other through the vibrant days♫

22:40.560 --> 22:46.690
♫I'll return your old dream to you♫

22:44.640 --> 22:45.170
Banxia.

22:45.260 --> 22:46.020
Let's go.

22:46.480 --> 22:47.070
Wait a moment.

22:47.120 --> 22:52.930
♫To get drunk for thousands of years♫

22:48.960 --> 22:49.590
Ji Li,

22:49.680 --> 22:50.510
this place is about to disintegrate.

22:50.510 --> 22:51.550
We need to leave quickly.

22:53.480 --> 22:56.690
♫River Styx flows♫

22:53.830 --> 22:55.110
This is his memory realm.

22:55.480 --> 22:56.240
He's dead.

22:56.830 --> 22:59.690
♫I'm afraid I can't forget the pain♫

22:57.400 --> 22:58.460
This place is going to collapse too.

22:59.270 --> 23:00.070
You should leave quickly.

23:00.090 --> 23:00.970
He's already dead.

23:00.330 --> 23:05.530
♫I don't regret the first meeting back then♫

23:01.000 --> 23:02.160
If you don't leave now, it'll be too late.

23:07.270 --> 23:08.720
The person I loved is dead.

23:10.870 --> 23:12.260
The person I hated is also dead.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.560
Everything is over.

23:18.860 --> 23:19.940
It's all self-inflicted.

23:20.680 --> 23:21.830
I can't blame anyone else.

23:23.200 --> 23:23.920
Hurry and leave.

23:32.540 --> 23:39.440
♫Share days and nights with you♫

23:34.310 --> 23:35.050
Let's go, Banxia.

23:35.110 --> 23:35.620
Go!

23:39.650 --> 23:45.440
♫In exchange for deep love♫

23:41.000 --> 23:41.720
Chuan.

23:44.590 --> 23:46.030
All love and hate have dissipated.

23:46.040 --> 23:49.190
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

23:47.770 --> 23:49.250
We're finally even.

23:49.330 --> 23:52.190
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

23:52.210 --> 23:58.100
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

24:08.750 --> 24:09.200
This…

24:09.480 --> 24:11.200
This doesn't reveal anything either.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.240
Is there a possibility

24:21.180 --> 24:22.900
that there's a secret passage in that inn?

24:23.400 --> 24:23.960
Impossible.

24:25.030 --> 24:25.980
I've torn up all the floorboards.

24:26.990 --> 24:28.590
So you've torn up the floorboards,

24:29.110 --> 24:31.000
but could there be a secret passage in the walls?

24:31.430 --> 24:32.670
I've torn down the walls too.

24:34.990 --> 24:35.660
You've torn down the walls too?

24:36.960 --> 24:37.880
Everything's been torn down.

24:59.840 --> 25:00.580
Are you alright?

25:12.030 --> 25:13.310
Wen Jian has an emergency at home.

25:13.640 --> 25:14.650
He can't make it to the appointment.

25:15.350 --> 25:16.790
What business do you have with Wen Jian?

25:19.720 --> 25:21.240
I want to know about the Ganshan Clinic case

25:21.330 --> 25:22.330
from six years ago.

25:26.640 --> 25:28.200
Six years ago, at Ganshan Clinic,

25:28.960 --> 25:30.640
Xuanye's entire family was

25:31.540 --> 25:32.560
murdered in one night.

25:34.830 --> 25:35.720
Everyone said

25:35.720 --> 25:37.000
it was Xuanye who did it.

25:37.610 --> 25:39.130
I believed that too at the time.

25:39.720 --> 25:41.070
Ganshan Clinic had few people,

25:41.750 --> 25:42.880
just Xuanye's family of four

25:43.550 --> 25:44.590
plus three apprentices.

25:45.360 --> 25:45.930
His father

25:45.960 --> 25:47.200
was a renowned physician.

25:48.920 --> 25:49.720
Still sleeping?

25:50.240 --> 25:50.880
Study hard.

25:51.410 --> 25:52.800
The brothers learned medicine from their father

25:52.830 --> 25:54.070
and gained some reputation.

25:54.920 --> 25:56.240
Ganshan Clinic usually

25:56.480 --> 25:57.480
made a living by setting bones

25:58.000 --> 25:59.350
and treating injuries.

25:59.880 --> 26:00.400
Of course,

26:01.270 --> 26:02.310
the father and sons

26:02.510 --> 26:03.680
had another identity.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.880
It's what you know.

26:06.680 --> 26:07.480
Demon hunters.

26:12.510 --> 26:13.960
When the murder occurred,

26:14.270 --> 26:15.310
I had just arrived in Guangping.

26:16.680 --> 26:18.310
It was the first case I handled

26:18.640 --> 26:19.880
after I came to Guangping City.

26:21.160 --> 26:22.550
It was also the most horrifying crime scene

26:23.630 --> 26:25.150
I had ever witnessed in my life.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.000
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes,

26:29.510 --> 26:30.680
I couldn't have imagined it at all.

27:14.550 --> 27:15.110
Father!

27:17.340 --> 27:18.030
Mother!

27:18.110 --> 27:18.750
Mother!

27:42.680 --> 27:43.350
Move aside!

28:20.000 --> 28:20.680
Xuanye.

28:24.110 --> 28:25.000
There's no saving them.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.250
There's no hope.

28:39.480 --> 28:41.030
Do it!

29:38.350 --> 29:39.000
Xuanye.

29:42.200 --> 29:42.830
Son.

29:44.750 --> 29:45.640
It's not your fault.

29:46.920 --> 29:47.790
It's not your fault.

29:49.200 --> 29:51.070
I was tricked by the Miasma Demon.

29:52.920 --> 29:54.270
But I've already killed it.

29:56.300 --> 29:57.060
You don't need to be afraid.

29:58.200 --> 29:59.270
It was I

30:01.590 --> 30:02.590
who harmed your mother,

30:03.790 --> 30:04.880
your elder brother,

30:06.500 --> 30:07.690
and everyone else.

30:09.340 --> 30:10.690
It has nothing to do with you.

30:12.110 --> 30:12.680
Father,

30:14.400 --> 30:15.160
it was me.

30:16.700 --> 30:18.330
I angered the Miasma Demon.

30:19.320 --> 30:20.650
That's why it came to Ganshan Clinic

30:20.680 --> 30:21.590
to seek revenge.

30:22.960 --> 30:24.240
I'm the one who harmed you all.

30:24.750 --> 30:26.270
Do you still remember

30:27.920 --> 30:28.920
what I told you before?

30:31.110 --> 30:32.270
People can be good or evil,

30:32.790 --> 30:34.510
and the same for demons.

30:38.960 --> 30:40.160
Even if your parents

30:40.920 --> 30:41.720
and brother

30:43.480 --> 30:44.590
were all killed by demons,

30:46.400 --> 30:47.750
you can't let hatred

30:47.750 --> 30:49.160
blind your eyes.

30:50.880 --> 30:53.070
Don't kill indiscriminately without distinguishing right from wrong.

30:54.600 --> 30:55.290
Also,

30:56.050 --> 30:56.920
in this world,

30:57.940 --> 30:59.460
you can go anywhere,

31:00.820 --> 31:02.230
except for the Underground City.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.250
Humans and demons mingle there,

31:05.270 --> 31:06.380
with powerful demons lurking.

31:07.920 --> 31:08.880
You must not go there.

31:12.350 --> 31:12.920
Also,

31:14.640 --> 31:15.790
this Bu'er Bracelet

31:17.030 --> 31:18.480
is your protective charm.

31:20.350 --> 31:21.480
As long as you have it,

31:23.880 --> 31:24.880
you'll be safe.

31:25.480 --> 31:26.480
Got it?

31:32.030 --> 31:32.680
Father,

31:34.360 --> 31:34.890
why are you

31:34.920 --> 31:35.960
suddenly telling me all this?

31:39.960 --> 31:40.720
It's alright,

31:42.550 --> 31:43.160
Xuanye.

31:43.750 --> 31:44.550
Xuanye.

31:49.720 --> 31:50.310
Father.

31:55.200 --> 31:55.920
Xuanye,

32:01.790 --> 32:02.550
Ganshan Clinic

32:04.550 --> 32:05.550
is now in your hands.

32:07.440 --> 32:08.030
Also,

32:08.550 --> 32:09.550
you must keep

32:10.200 --> 32:11.590
the Hidden Dragon Case safe.

32:12.440 --> 32:13.310
Those five swords

32:14.030 --> 32:15.350
are not ordinary weapons,

32:15.750 --> 32:16.880
especially the last two.

32:17.790 --> 32:18.880
Never use them unless

32:19.240 --> 32:20.440
it's absolutely necessary.

32:25.200 --> 32:25.960
Xuanye...

32:27.880 --> 32:28.440
The sword!

32:28.640 --> 32:29.550
Changle Sword!

32:30.240 --> 32:30.920
Xuanye!

32:33.880 --> 32:34.350
Father.

32:34.550 --> 32:35.270
I'll save you.

32:37.160 --> 32:38.350
Don't waste your energy.

32:39.920 --> 32:41.000
It's not the time for karma yet.

32:42.270 --> 32:43.400
Eternal joy has not appeared.

32:43.740 --> 32:45.130
It means all of this

32:46.550 --> 32:47.960
is destined.

32:48.950 --> 32:50.200
Our Jiu family

32:52.070 --> 32:53.240
is fated

32:54.360 --> 32:55.800
to face this tribulation.

32:59.960 --> 33:00.790
It's just that

33:02.440 --> 33:03.440
you've suffered so much.

33:04.830 --> 33:05.640
Xuanye,

33:06.350 --> 33:07.750
I don't know

33:08.350 --> 33:09.270
what's best

33:11.230 --> 33:12.790
for you.

33:15.440 --> 33:17.790
I'm afraid I've made a mistake.

33:23.350 --> 33:24.000
Father.

33:24.640 --> 33:25.110
Father.

33:25.400 --> 33:26.110
Hold on.

33:26.920 --> 33:28.480
There are so many demon hunters in this world.

33:28.960 --> 33:29.680
We'll surely find

33:30.000 --> 33:31.000
a demon hunter who can

33:31.000 --> 33:31.680
cure the miasma poison.

33:31.960 --> 33:32.880
I'll take you to get treatment.

33:33.000 --> 33:33.590
Let's go!

33:36.680 --> 33:37.750
It's no use.

33:40.240 --> 33:41.160
It's no use.

34:06.310 --> 34:06.920
Son,

34:09.670 --> 34:10.480
remember this.

34:13.280 --> 34:14.360
Only you

34:15.590 --> 34:16.550
can decide

34:18.590 --> 34:19.760
who you are.

34:38.550 --> 34:39.110
Father.

34:41.230 --> 34:41.880
Father.

34:43.710 --> 34:44.710
Father!

34:53.590 --> 34:54.070
When I arrived

34:54.070 --> 34:55.030
at the crime scene,

34:55.110 --> 34:55.840
it was already daybreak.

34:56.550 --> 34:57.880
Xuanye was kneeling in a pool of blood,

34:59.000 --> 34:59.670
holding

34:59.670 --> 35:01.150
the dagger that killed his father.

35:01.760 --> 35:02.710
The scene at that time

35:02.730 --> 35:03.360
made it obvious

35:03.360 --> 35:04.000
that everyone

35:04.000 --> 35:05.030
had died by Xuanye's hand.

35:05.030 --> 35:05.880
It was undeniable.

35:06.480 --> 35:07.920
So I arrested him.

35:09.280 --> 35:10.840
All these years, I firmly believed

35:11.320 --> 35:12.670
he was the murderer.

35:14.550 --> 35:15.480
Until these past few days…

35:19.110 --> 35:19.890
Until these past few days,

35:19.920 --> 35:21.370
I came to believe in the existence of demons.

35:22.110 --> 35:23.320
So I went to ask Wen Jian.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.320
Wen Jian told me

35:26.130 --> 35:27.740
Xuanye's entire family had been poisoned by a demon.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.710
The poison was extremely vicious.

35:30.710 --> 35:32.550
Once poisoned, one would lose their mind

35:32.760 --> 35:34.030
and become like a wild beast.

35:34.710 --> 35:36.100
Xuanye killing his family

35:38.070 --> 35:39.630
must have been an act of desperation.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.070
But at that time,

35:45.110 --> 35:46.920
he didn't say a word in his own defense.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.280
Then what did he say?

35:51.280 --> 35:53.070
He said he was the murderer.

35:54.670 --> 35:55.510
But why?

35:56.840 --> 35:58.000
I used to think

35:58.670 --> 35:59.880
he had nothing to say in his defense.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.320
But now it seems

36:03.320 --> 36:04.320
at that time,

36:05.440 --> 36:06.630
he was suicidal.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.190
As the day

36:09.190 --> 36:10.070
of his execution approached,

36:10.710 --> 36:11.440
Xuanye's master

36:11.460 --> 36:12.350
suddenly came to Guangping.

36:13.150 --> 36:14.360
That man had some influence.

36:14.560 --> 36:15.930
I don't know what methods he used,

36:15.960 --> 36:17.000
but he convinced the prefectural governor.

36:17.550 --> 36:18.550
As a result, the case

36:18.920 --> 36:20.280
was ruled as the work of bandits.

36:21.190 --> 36:22.630
Xuanye was acquitted.

36:23.440 --> 36:24.670
Of course, I wasn't convinced.

36:25.550 --> 36:26.960
But the prefectural governor said

36:27.480 --> 36:28.710
the bandits were just an excuse.

36:29.210 --> 36:30.160
The truth was

36:30.480 --> 36:31.670
there were demons at work.

36:32.630 --> 36:33.280
At that time,

36:33.280 --> 36:34.480
how could I possibly believe it?

36:48.510 --> 36:49.360
Chief Constable Chu.

36:50.960 --> 36:51.930
Do you know

36:51.970 --> 36:53.290
if Xuanye ever suffered

36:53.320 --> 36:54.360
any serious injuries?

36:55.920 --> 36:56.840
In this line of work,

36:57.360 --> 36:58.360
who doesn't get injured?

37:00.190 --> 37:01.670
I mean injuries from when he was young.

37:03.070 --> 37:04.230
Then I know even less about that.

37:04.970 --> 37:05.890
All these years, I thought

37:05.920 --> 37:06.890
he was a murderer.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.030
I made things difficult for him everywhere.

37:09.070 --> 37:10.590
I can't say we were friends.

37:16.630 --> 37:17.510
I really want to know

37:17.510 --> 37:19.030
what Xuanye was like before.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.150
I heard from Wen Jian

37:23.070 --> 37:24.440
that he was a free-spirited and outgoing person,

37:25.760 --> 37:26.710
unrestrained and carefree.

37:33.550 --> 37:34.000
Don't be afraid.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.200
I'm here to save you.

37:36.050 --> 37:38.900
♫A familiar figure♫

37:37.280 --> 37:39.320
You've got some skills, demon.

37:39.630 --> 37:40.670
Vivacious and confident.

37:39.690 --> 37:42.140
♫Becomes clear in the haze♫

37:43.130 --> 37:47.140
♫Yet it's out of reach♫

37:44.240 --> 37:44.920
Don't worry.

37:45.120 --> 37:46.810
No demons alive now can hurt me.

37:47.590 --> 37:49.230
He thought he was destined for greatness

37:49.320 --> 37:49.960
and was extraordinary.

37:50.140 --> 37:53.140
♫Your earnest reminders♫

37:50.280 --> 37:51.150
He was arrogant

37:51.840 --> 37:52.550
and very cocky.

37:52.960 --> 37:53.600
Bah!

37:53.510 --> 37:56.390
♫And words of concern♫

37:54.280 --> 37:55.480
You're quite an old demon.

37:55.550 --> 37:56.590
Have some shame, will you?

37:56.980 --> 38:02.460
♫They've woven and colored the time we shared♫

37:58.590 --> 37:59.630
But now he...

38:02.590 --> 38:03.800
Anyone who had gone through such an experience

38:03.900 --> 38:06.910
♫Traces of bond♫

38:04.480 --> 38:05.360
would change.

38:07.390 --> 38:10.390
♫With a sigh, we bid farewell♫

38:08.280 --> 38:09.360
Do you know what was the first thing

38:09.440 --> 38:10.480
he said to me when I arrived

38:10.480 --> 38:11.230
at the crime scene?

38:10.830 --> 38:16.210
♫Keeping you company, and seeing you off on a long journey♫

38:11.960 --> 38:12.920
What was it?

38:14.800 --> 38:15.960
He asked me to kill him.

38:17.890 --> 38:20.780
♫You're the same as before♫

38:21.180 --> 38:24.530
♫And I'm still following closely behind♫

38:22.710 --> 38:23.710
Thankfully, it's all in the past now.

38:24.860 --> 38:29.970
♫Remember it day and night♫

38:27.880 --> 38:28.480
Yes,

38:30.320 --> 38:31.110
it's all over now.

38:31.290 --> 38:33.130
♫One side is the past♫

38:33.150 --> 38:37.500
♫Where you lingered♫

38:38.220 --> 38:39.920
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

38:39.940 --> 38:43.890
♫Dream of mine♫

38:45.230 --> 38:45.760
Xuanye,

38:45.310 --> 38:48.530
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

38:46.400 --> 38:47.000
you're back?

38:48.960 --> 38:49.670
Are you hungry?

38:49.020 --> 38:51.530
♫Each drop into my heart♫

38:50.360 --> 38:51.960
If you are, grab a snack first.

38:52.250 --> 38:57.030
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

38:52.400 --> 38:53.400
Dinner will be ready soon.

38:56.510 --> 38:57.480
Xuanye, look.

38:57.760 --> 38:58.760
The goods we got this time are excellent.

38:58.810 --> 39:05.350
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

38:58.960 --> 38:59.840
We'll surely make a lot of money.

39:00.000 --> 39:00.550
Yes, Xuanye,

39:00.840 --> 39:01.550
they're really good.

39:06.550 --> 39:07.110
Xuanye.

39:07.920 --> 39:08.440
Xuanye.

39:09.190 --> 39:10.300
I'll give you five strings of cash

39:10.630 --> 39:11.710
if you go and beat up your brother.

39:13.190 --> 39:13.630
Father,

39:13.960 --> 39:14.790
are you a sore loser?

39:15.120 --> 39:15.640
As the saying goes,

39:15.670 --> 39:17.070
what's inside will manifest outside.

39:16.480 --> 39:18.190
♫One side is the past♫

39:17.400 --> 39:18.710
Observe the small to know the great, and use medicine dialectically.

39:18.220 --> 39:22.440
♫Where you lingered♫

39:18.760 --> 39:19.630
This is what you taught me.

39:19.760 --> 39:20.230
Then did I teach you

39:20.230 --> 39:21.400
to feed lamb lung soup to the Moon Bugs?

39:21.590 --> 39:22.190
They like it.

39:22.440 --> 39:22.800
This...

39:23.190 --> 39:23.960
I'll beat you to death!

39:23.340 --> 39:25.070
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

39:24.110 --> 39:25.000
They like it?

39:25.160 --> 39:29.570
♫Dream of mine♫

39:27.550 --> 39:28.320
Get down here!

39:28.320 --> 39:29.230
Run! Run!

39:29.280 --> 39:30.110
Run! Run!

39:30.110 --> 39:31.190
What are you doing?

39:30.280 --> 39:33.820
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

39:32.590 --> 39:33.840
What did you do to upset your father again?

39:33.880 --> 39:34.590
Mother, Mother!

39:34.040 --> 39:36.990
♫Each drop into my heart♫

39:34.710 --> 39:35.360
Mother, look!

39:35.550 --> 39:36.000
You little rascal!

39:37.340 --> 39:42.760
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

39:43.890 --> 39:50.040
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

39:55.880 --> 39:56.480
I never thought

39:56.510 --> 39:57.710
that Physician Jiu had experienced

39:57.710 --> 39:59.000
such a tragic event.

40:09.280 --> 40:10.000
My lady,

40:11.000 --> 40:11.920
what are you looking at?

40:14.550 --> 40:15.360
Nothing.

40:21.070 --> 40:23.560
[Duan Mansion]

40:35.400 --> 40:36.000
Young Master.

40:38.440 --> 40:38.920
Young Master.

40:39.510 --> 40:40.510
A letter has arrived from Yuanzhou.

40:47.920 --> 40:48.440
Young Master,

40:49.070 --> 40:50.110
is there news about the lady?

40:51.880 --> 40:53.150
Mr. Xu, please prepare my horse.

40:53.920 --> 40:54.550
Yes.

41:10.880 --> 41:11.710
I told you

41:11.710 --> 41:13.000
I'm really not feeling well.

41:13.660 --> 41:14.440
Ever since I arrived,

41:14.440 --> 41:15.880
my cold hasn't gotten better.

41:16.550 --> 41:17.840
And you said I didn't need to take medicine.

41:19.070 --> 41:19.800
Have a seat first.

41:20.110 --> 41:21.040
I'll check your pulse in a moment.

41:22.070 --> 41:23.440
It's still just a cold.

41:23.840 --> 41:25.110
Some medicine will do the trick.

41:28.670 --> 41:29.880
If you're busy,

41:30.190 --> 41:31.330
just tell me the herbs,

41:31.360 --> 41:32.280
I'll prepare them myself.

41:34.960 --> 41:35.750
You'll prepare them?

41:39.440 --> 41:39.960
Alright.

41:41.280 --> 41:42.190
Ten grams of fangfeng.

41:47.670 --> 41:49.110
Fangfeng is in...

41:49.230 --> 41:50.920
The fourth drawer of the third row.

41:56.550 --> 41:57.190
I found it.

42:12.480 --> 42:14.180
You slept for six days straight

42:14.800 --> 42:16.070
without eating or drinking anything.

42:16.480 --> 42:17.730
I was afraid you'd starve to death.

42:18.760 --> 42:20.190
I wanted to bring you some food,

42:20.480 --> 42:21.630
but Chi Xue wouldn't let me.

42:22.190 --> 42:24.550
He said when you're asleep,

42:24.840 --> 42:25.710
you don't need to eat or drink.

42:26.880 --> 42:27.800
Banxia,

42:33.180 --> 42:34.290
Five grams of banxia.
